    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "bdbac7a517228587b833": "Fishmaster Bassbait has had the waters here seeded with high quality Tastyfish so he can have his tournament.\n\nOnce he gets his winner, I will give you silver for each five Tastyfish you bring me!\n"
